This folder contains two samples to evaluate Chagas-XAI application. Both files are in .mat format

- Healthy subject (from PTB-XL database)
- Patient with chronic CD (from SaMi-Trop database)

The samples were taken from the test set. Both samples are available from the [PTB-XL](https://physionet.org/content/ptb-xl/1.0.3/) and [SaMi-Trop](https://zenodo.org/records/4905618) repositories
